Subject: Copy preview padding without filtering transparent neighbors

Freecut MIT adaptation (FL-100). Preserve the central preview copy and
caller context state; only boundary-pixel duplication disables smoothing.
The disposal regression checks state restoration on an edge-copy error.
This patch does not resolve the independent interior DOM/raster disparity.

